  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2023 Aichi was held at Aichi Sky Expo on 25 and 26 February 2023, without spectators, with the master league alone on the first day. It was the first tournament to give Victory Symbol, the Scarlet & Violet-era trophy card, and the top four of each league were invited to the 2023 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Symbol in a print for their place, with the placing and the city in small text on the Champions League logo: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
